00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:46.429
if there is any way to get around getting
yourself in any sort of debt go that way so

00:12:46.429 --> 00:12:52.029
do I recommend or not recommend a formal education
I feel like that's your personal choice what

00:12:52.029 --> 00:12:57.119
I will say is don't go into debt if there's
any way to avoid debt or manage it or at least

00:12:57.119 --> 00:13:02.129
know that if you're going to go into a reasonable
