00:13:02.129 --> 00:13:10.160
it you know it's it's it's something that
is viable not something you get nor I hear

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:14.610
these to me horror stories from friends that
have gotten themselves in north of 100 000

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:20.250
